Which of the following is the correct declaration of self-referential structure?
(A) struct node* {int data; node *link;}
(B) struct node {int data; struct node *link;};
(C) struct node {int data; node *link;}
(D) struct node* {int data; struct node *link;}

How do you initialize an array in C?
(A) int arr[3] = (1,2,3);
(B) int arr(3) = {1,2,3};
(C) int arr[3] = {1,2,3};
(D) int arr(3) = (1,2,3);

Which of the following c code is used to create a new node?
(A) ptr=(NODE*)malloc(sizeof(NODE));
(B) ptr=(NODE*)malloc(NODE);
(C) ptr=(NODE*)malloc(sizeof(NODE*));
(D) ptr=(NODE)malloc(sizeof(NODE));
